#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Anda tidak mempunyai kebenaran untuk peranti kluster itu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Nama: kluster lain sudah menggunakan nama ini."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Kluster tidak disimpan: ia telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak borang dibuka, atau penulisan gagal. Buka semula dan ulangi perubahan tersebut."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Kluster telah disimpan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Keadaan kluster tidak diubah: penulisan gagal. Lihat log Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Kluster dan syot kilat dalam cache telah dipadamkan. Peranti dan grafnya dikekalkan. Penjadual tidak dihubungi."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Peranti dan grafnya telah dicipta."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Peranti tidak dicipta: kluster sudah mempunyai peranti, ia telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak halaman dibuka, atau Cacti menolaknya. Lihat log Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Kluster telah dipetakan ke peranti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Kluster tidak dipetakan: peranti tidak wujud, tidak dibenarkan untuk anda, sudah membawa kluster lain, atau kluster telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak halaman dibuka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Graf yang tiada telah ditambah."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Tiada graf ditambah: kluster tidak mempunyai peranti, atau perantinya tidak lagi wujud."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Kluster tidak dinyahpetakan: ia telah diubah oleh orang lain sejak halaman dibuka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Kluster telah dinyahpetakan. Peranti dan grafnya dikekalkan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Partisi telah diindeks semula daripada syot kilat."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks semula: peranti dinyahdayakan atau tidak dapat dicapai, jadi Cacti melangkau kueri datanya."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks semula: Cacti tidak dapat menjalankan kueri data. Lihat log Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks semula: kueri data Penjadual HPC tidak dipasang. Pasang templat daripada halaman kesihatan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Partisi tidak diindeks semula: kluster tidak mempunyai peranti, atau perantinya tidak lagi wujud."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Templat Penjadual HPC telah dipasang."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Templat tidak dipasang: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Paparan pemantauan"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Pemerhatian tidak dapat dibaca. Minta pentadbir menyemak log pemalam."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Periksa keluarga sebab tertunda dan kesegaran syot kilat pada gambaran keseluruhan. Eskalasi kelayakan, pemetaan kluster dan dasar penyelenggaraan kepada pentadbir."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Nama: gunakan 1 hingga 64 huruf, digit, titik, sempang atau garis bawah, bermula dengan huruf atau digit."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: pilih salah satu poller yang disenaraikan."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Selang Pengumpulan: masukkan saat bulat dari %d hingga %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Pengangkutan: pilih satu daripada pengangkutan yang disenaraikan."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: masukkan laluan mutlak, atau biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan lalai poller."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "URL slurmrestd: hos dan port ini tiada dalam senarai hos slurmrestd di Tetapan."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "URL slurmrestd: masukkan URL https:// tanpa nama pengguna, kueri atau serpihan; http:// biasa hanya diterima untuk alamat gelung balik."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Pengguna slurmrestd: gunakan paling banyak 64 huruf, digit, titik, sempang atau garis bawah, atau biarkan kosong untuk token pengguna."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Fail Token: masukkan laluan mutlak fail token pada poller. Token itu sendiri tidak pernah dimasukkan di sini."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Fail Token: belum ada direktori fail token ditetapkan. Minta pentadbir Cacti menetapkannya di bawah Tetapan, Penjadual HPC."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Fail Token: fail mesti berada di dalam salah satu direktori fail token yang ditetapkan dalam Tetapan (%s)."

