#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "Saiz Jawapan Maksimum ialah %d MiB, tetapi jawapan yang dinyahkod sebesar itu tidak muat dalam Memori Pengumpulan sebanyak %d MiB; pembaca membenarkan %d MiB. Naikkan Memori Pengumpulan atau turunkan Saiz Jawapan Maksimum dalam Tetapan."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Ditugaskan kepada poller %d, pengumpul data jauh. Keluaran ini hanya mengumpul pada poller utama, jadi kluster tidak dikumpul; pengumpulan jauh dirancang untuk fasa 3. Tugaskannya kepada poller utama."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval is below the %d second floor."
msgstr "Selang pengumpulan berada di bawah had minimum %d saat."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval of %d seconds is shorter than the poller interval of %d seconds; data is collected every %d seconds."
msgstr "Selang pengumpulan selama %d saat adalah lebih pendek daripada selang poller selama %d saat; data dikumpul setiap %d saat."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "slurmrestd is reached over plain HTTP on the loopback address; the token crosses the local network stack unencrypted."
msgstr "slurmrestd dicapai melalui HTTP biasa pada alamat gelung balik; token merentasi tindanan rangkaian tempatan tanpa penyulitan."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "No reader run has finished for this cluster yet."
msgstr "Belum ada larian pembaca yang selesai untuk kluster ini."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token file: %s."
msgstr "Fail token: %s."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The token expired %s."
msgstr "Token telah tamat tempoh %s."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The token expires in %d minutes."
msgstr "Token akan tamat tempoh dalam %d minit."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last run used its whole time budget of %d seconds; some sections were not collected."
msgstr "Larian terakhir menggunakan keseluruhan bajet masanya selama %d saat; beberapa bahagian tidak dikumpul."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The scheduler reports Slurm %s, which is not a supported release (%s)."
msgstr "Penjadual melaporkan Slurm %s, yang bukan keluaran yang disokong (%s)."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The scheduler reports Slurm %s, which does not ship the data parser %s chosen in Settings."
msgstr "Penjadual melaporkan Slurm %s, yang tidak menyertakan penghurai data %s yang dipilih dalam Tetapan."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "Client commands ran without a memory limit; set the prlimit path in Settings."
msgstr "Perintah klien dijalankan tanpa had memori; tetapkan laluan prlimit dalam Tetapan."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Last error: %s."
msgstr "Ralat terakhir: %s."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection is paused for %d seconds after a rate limit."
msgstr "Pengumpulan dijeda selama %d saat selepas had kadar."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "Data is stale; graphs and alerts read it as unknown."
msgstr "Data telah lapuk; graf dan makluman membacanya sebagai tidak diketahui."

